# High Fae Trickster: "You may cast spells as though they had flash" (CR 702.8a, 611.3a) is a static ability: it works only while the Trickster is on
# the battlefield. Bot1 flashes it in during Bot2's upkeep and kills it with its own Lightning Bolt on turn 3; in Bot2's upkeep on turn 4 the
# Ornithopter Bot1 drew is a creature spell without flash again and is refused.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
High Fae Trickster
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

